          "items": [
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 1,
              "text": "第2章 反派的日常就是找茬"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 2,
              "text": "严正声明：本书出场角色均已满18岁！不存在任何未成年人！"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 3,
              "text": "——————————"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 4,
              "text": "“哗啦啦啦——”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 5,
              "text": "“哗呸！”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 6,
              "text": "吐掉嘴里的牙膏泡沫，苏天晴默默放下手中那只可爱的猫猫水杯与牙刷，双手撑住洗手池，抬起脑袋看向镜子里的金毛狐狐。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 7,
              "text": "五官无可挑剔，精致可爱，毛发柔顺肌肤光滑，能从宽松睡衣的领口瞥见浅浅的河谷，那双不安中带着些许惊讶的眼眸更是摄人心魄，仿佛有着狐人生来便有的魅意。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 8,
              "text": "抛开那听起来就很离谱的反派魔法少女不谈，这副身体的模样还真是绝妙中的绝妙。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 9,
              "text": "每一个细节都满足了自己曾经的幻想，让人很想细细品尝一番——"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 10,
              "text": "“舔。”"
            }
          ],
