          },
          "scope": {
            "readAt": {
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 66
            },
            "perspective": "reader",
            "world": "original"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 42,
              "text": "材质不明的金色十字星，做工蛮精致，手感扎实，不像是塑料玩具，这个应该就是魔法少女们必备的变身道具了吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 47,
              "text": "魔法少女变身！穿着华丽的洋装在城市间穿梭飞行与怪人战斗！这具身体的原主人也曾经梦想过这种场面！"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 50,
              "text": "“变……变身！”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 52,
              "text": "嗯？不对吗？变身不是这么喊的？还是说要加点什么前缀？"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 53,
              "text": "“魔法少女变身！”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 57,
              "text": "狐狐嗓子都快喊哑了，脑子里能想到的变身词全喊了一遍，却仍是没见手中这枚十字星有丁点动静。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 58,
              "text": "不是，你这秘典都不给点新手指引的吗，别人拿到系统多少都有个新手任务好伐，至少教我怎么变身嘛！"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 61,
              "text": "也没见这上面有写字呀，到底要怎么才能变身呢。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c02",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 2,
              "paragraph": 66,
              "text": "【初次变身，已完成】"
            }
          ],
